1
00:00:39,131 --> 00:00:48,432
I see you walk through gravel grey,
To wipe the winter dust away.

2
00:00:48,568 --> 00:01:00,601
Your hands are cold, your heart is sore,
Beside my stone forevermore.

3
00:01:01,736 --> 00:01:11,292
Your love was like a primal cry,
And I would never let it die.

4
00:01:11,382 --> 00:01:25,814
This scar you bear is very deep,
The most beautiful thing you keep.

5
00:01:29,422 --> 00:01:38,763
You laid the little stone you found,
Upon my quiet, sleeping ground.

6
00:01:38,832 --> 00:01:53,220
And through the years Luna came to see,
The silent bond you left with me.

7
00:01:56,724 --> 00:02:06,166
Your love was like a primal cry,
And I would never let it die.

8
00:02:06,249 --> 00:02:20,266
This scar you bear is very deep,
The most beautiful thing you keep.

9
00:02:56,108 --> 00:03:05,405
Luna saw your stone, she knew you cared,
She kept the secret that you shared.

10
00:03:05,644 --> 00:03:24,056
I feel your tears upon my clay,
I'll wash your bitter pain away.

11
00:03:24,263 --> 00:03:32,631
I hear you whisper in the cold,
Our secret story has been told.

12
00:03:32,668 --> 00:03:54,175
Luna hears you, Paul, she always knew, 
My silent grave is keeping you.

